that relates to Georgia. That was during a&nbsp;
phone call that the failed twice indicted,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:11.520 --> 00:00:17.820
twice impeached former president had on the&nbsp;
phone with Georgia officials saying, I only need&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:18.480 --> 00:00:24.780
11,000 votes to defeat Joe Biden. Give me a break.&nbsp;
