doing this. And this once again fits this theme.&nbsp;
We get one report, and many of his defenders say&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:47.100 --> 00:00:52.440
so out of character. He would never do this.&nbsp;
We now have two independent, unrelated reports,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:52.440 --> 00:00:59.100
