LeAnn Caldwell from the Community Radio Days,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:59.100 --> 00:01:05.700
Josh Dawsey and Yvonne Wingert. SANCHEZ&nbsp;
Trump pressured Arizona Governor Doug Ducey&nbsp;&nbsp;

